{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Checks a JavaScript command without running it: regenerates its editor files from the store (<lib>/<ctl>/<cmd>.js with JSDoc types from the declared params, and flowlang.d.ts), compiles it in V8 as the engine would install it, and type-checks it with TypeScript's tsc against flowlang.d.ts when tsc is found ($FLOWLANG_TSC, node_modules/.bin/tsc next to data/, or tsc on the PATH) - names the engine does not provide, such as fetch or require, are errors, and flowlang.api calls are checked against the callee's declared params. Returns {status, command, tsc: 'ran'|'not installed'|'skipped', clean, problems: [{tool: 'syntax'|'tsc', severity, where, line, column, message}]} - `where` is the author's own line: 'body line N'. clean is false when any problem is an error; status is 'err' only when the check cannot run (not a JavaScript command, a build without javascript_runtime). Use it after upsert_command / patch_command_body on a JavaScript command.","import":"use ndata::dataobject::DataObject;\nuse flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse flowlang::buildrust::build;\nuse std::path::Path;","params":[{"name":"lib","type":"String"},{"name":"ctl","type":"String"},{"name":"cmd","type":"String"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"uuowqh1a1a0efa6baj1","readers":[],"time":1793701435129,"username":"system","writers":[]}